<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;">Hi&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; background: yellow;">&lt;name&gt;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;">,</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;">Life is a gift.
Give blood. Many may need lifesaving blood right now and the only source is
volunteer blood donors. Join us as we embark on a mission that can make an
immense difference in the lives of countless individuals. </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;">Our goal is to collect <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;number&gt;</span> blood
donations, so know your blood is in high demand.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;
color:black">Our goal is not only to meet 100% of our blood drive goal but also
to emphasize the importance of contributing to the diversity of the blood
supply.&nbsp; Diverse blood donors are crucial in ensuring that the unique
needs of patients from various backgrounds, especially those with rare blood
types or conditions such as sickle cell disease.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="1" type="1"><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;"><b>Diverse Patient Needs</b></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;">:
     Patients from different ethnic backgrounds may require blood with specific
     antigen profiles. <i>Your unique blood composition could be the lifeline
     for someone in need.</i>&nbsp;</span></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="color:black;margin-bottom:0in;
     margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Community Unity</span></b><span style="font-family:
     &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">:
     By embracing diversity in our donor community, we reflect the unity that
     defines our society. <i>Your participation helps build a stronger, more
     inclusive community.</i>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="color:black;margin-bottom:0in;
     margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Addressing Health Disparities</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">: Certain blood disorders, like sickle cell disease,
     are more prevalent in specific ethnic groups. <i>Your donation can
     directly impact patients facing these health disparities.</i>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;">Your willingness to contribute ensures that we can provide diverse
and lifesaving support to those who depend on us. We look forward to seeing you
at the blood drive and appreciate your ongoing support.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;">Visit
redcrossblood.org and enter code </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;sponsor code&gt;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"> to schedule your appointment today. You can
also reply to me at this email, or </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;call &gt;</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"> me at </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;phone number</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"> &gt;. Even if you cannot donate blood yourself,
you can still help by encouraging friends, family and coworkers to donate.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Light&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
